# Animated Tales — repo tracks contracts and code, never media.
# Folder is ~1.7 GB, overwhelmingly .mp4. Committing media makes the repo unusable.

# --- Media (never tracked) ---
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm
*.mp3
*.wav
*.m4a
*.aac
*.flac
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.gif
*.webp
*.avif
*.tiff
*.psd

# --- Build / runtime junk ---
node_modules/
**/.cache/
**/temp/
**/tmp/
*.log

# --- OS junk ---
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- Generisani artefakti alata ---
episodes/*/qa-report.md
tests/fixtures/*-episode/qa-report.md
episodes/*/qc-report.md
tests/fixtures/*-episode/qc-report.md
episodes/*/storyboard.md
tests/fixtures/*-episode/storyboard.md

# --- Explicitly tracked despite the rules above ---
!.gitignore

# Fixture klipovi za F1 (C06): 16x16 crni testsrc, 2 KB po fajlu, ukupno ~14 KB.
# Bez njih se F1 ne može pustiti iz komandne linije nad fixture-om, a fixture koji
# traži korak generisanja pre upotrebe nije fixture. Prava medija ostaje van gita.
!tests/fixtures/*-episode/shots/*.mp4

# Iz istog razloga i slike still fixture-a: 64x36 testsrc, ~0.9 KB po fajlu.
# Na still shotu je slika ono što F1 traži na disku, pa bez njih fixture ne postoji.
!tests/fixtures/*-episode/shots/*.jpeg
